        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6554 Rope Mortise Barclay Entry Set with 5054 Half-Round Rope Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe historic design of the 6554 Barclay features an arched top and bottom with rope detailing reminiscent of European architectural elements, while the coordinating 5064 knob helps accentuate the ever classic design. This Baldwin Entrance Set will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\". It is constructed out of solid brass and comes backed with a mechanical lifetime limited warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own products.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-rope-knobset-baldwin-5064\"><b>Baldwin 5064 Rope Knobset</b></a><br>\r\nand <a href=\"/products/mortise-barclay-rope-lever-entrance-set-baldwin-6939\"><b>Barclay Mortise Entry Set with Rope Lever</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional 6554 Barclay Door Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-duty mortise lock body.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt with two hardened inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, operation, and Lifetime PVD Polished Brass (003) finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ornate Estate Collection Barclay Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5064 Knob</li>\r\n<li>Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .275\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6554.pdf?v=1691094973\" target=\"new\"><b>Barclay Entry Set Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob operates the entrance set latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob operates entrance set latch; while from the interior, it is operated by a knob. The deadbolt is operated by a key from both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-3-Functions-entryset.jpg?v=1704354505\" width=\"350\" height=\"125\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Functions Chart\">\r\n</p>",
